// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2271572093" "You heard of the Hellions? I'm sure you've seen 'em around Port Oakes. Anyway, they stole a bunch of crates of goods from the Family, and the Family wants payback. This would be a great way to gain favor with the Family and maybe get more jobs from them. I managed to find out where the Hellions were hiding out. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Head to the Hellions base where they're hiding the goods and take them out!</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3843626286" "Defeat all Hellions"
// SendOffString :
"P3087388949" "Don't leave any of them standing! Take out everyone in that Hellion base!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P872737556" "What are you waitin' for? Those Hellions are still out there!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2507520596" "You kick up dust from the floor as you enter this run-down warehouse."

